{"id": "34453", "title": "粘人相公", "author": "橙星", "category": "文学名著", "count": 43, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34453.htm", "intro": "佟灵儿从来没遇过这么不要脸的赖皮男！一天到晚缠着她叫她娘子，像猴 \r\n子一样“巴”在她身上，就连睡觉睡到一半，他也可以神不知鬼不觉地出现在 \r\n她的床上！还说什么夫妻本应同房，他哪只耳朵听到她要嫁给他啦？！搞清楚 \r\n！她来他们阎谷是要替谷主治病，他敢对她这个贵宾无礼？不要命了啊！但… \r\n…这个严肃的冰山男就是谷主？！别开玩笑了，他不是赖皮男吗？什么？要她 \r\n救救谷主的双面人个性？拜托～～解铃还须系铃人，就算她是神医，但害谷主 \r\n人格分裂的人又不是她，她怎么救得成嘛……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34453", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2186767.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2186768.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2186769.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2186770.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2186771.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2186772.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2186773.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2186774.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2186775.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2186776.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2186777.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2186778.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2186779.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2186780.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2186781.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2186782.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2186783.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2186784.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2186785.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2186786.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2186787.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2186788.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2186789.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2186790.html", "available": false}, {"title":